      File &quot;/Users/moon/Projects/zeppelin/spark-1.4.0-bin-hadoop2.3/python/lib/py4j-0.8.2.1-src.zip/py4j/java_gateway.py&quot;, line 529, in _&lt;em&gt;call&lt;/em&gt;_&lt;br/&gt;
